      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Заключение</div><div class=\"s-num\">В следующий раз</div><h2>Снеговик и своя папка</h2><p class=\"s-big\">Сохраним рисунок, чтобы он не потерялся</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 230.0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg\"><svg x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"150.0\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 150\"><rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#cfe3f5\"></rect><rect x=\"0\" y=\"118\" width=\"200\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#eef4fa\"></rect><path d=\"M0 118 Q60 110 120 118 Q160 124 200 116\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b0c4d6\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"112\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#90a4ae\" stroke-width=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#90a4ae\" stroke-width=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"32\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#90a4ae\" stroke-width=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M100 34 L122 38 L100 40 Z\" fill=\"#fb8c00\"></path><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"29\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#263238\"></circle><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"29\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#263238\"></circle><path d=\"M88 20 L112 20 L109 4 L91 4 Z\" fill=\"#e53935\" stroke=\"#b71c1c\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#263238\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"72\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#263238\"></circle></svg><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"150.0\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e7d3c2\" stroke-width=\"3\"></rect><path d=\"M230 95.0 L264 95.0\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M258 84.0 L272 95.0 L258 106.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><text x=\"120.0\" y=\"212.0\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#222\" text-anchor=\"middle\">снеговик</text><svg x=\"280\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"150.0\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 150\"><rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#fff8